msgid ""
"Ohh, you got a letter for me? From Ted? Let me see...\n"
"\n"
"\"Dear Hugo, thanks for your help the other day.\n"
"This guy is not as useless as he seems.\n"
"Maybe he can help you with your problem.\""
msgstr "哦，你給我帶了封信？泰德寫的？讓我看看……\n"
"\n"
"“親愛的雨果，謝謝你前幾天的幫忙。\n"
"這傢伙並不像看上去那麼沒用。\n"
"也許他能幫你解決你的問題。”"

